{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「台灣第一名媛」孫芸芸在女兒廖思惟升格當媽後，也正式成為「最美阿嬤」。近日適逢孫芸芸48歲生日，廖思惟特地在社群平台曬出母女合照替媽媽慶生</p><p>孫芸芸於5月14日迎來48歲生日，26歲的廖思惟隨後在小紅書分享3張母女同框照，並附上「蛋糕」、「拉炮」、「愛心」等表情符號，低調替媽媽送上生日祝福。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133377681291743232431267.jpeg/VEcyi0iOYU7pIJMX_L85v7f81gbBq9vPU7-dqFO_nag\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><p>更多孫芸芸的相片：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378927457210368352687.jpeg/NmuLStbo1Efk5xywr9wQPsyXz6LerlwvjmXMd45lzHc\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378929822928896537162.jpeg/F0OIyOHiOhDI32qoKuoDkIlZ7N8BHlbDw6eI-MOniPg\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378932238979072261408.jpeg/ka1BD6-8m8c1Tu5hVC14XrBxlziXRYOa2RBxI9kQcSM\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378934713749504783496.jpeg/vycUq9NWmiqZx1kvcqZRbwyjEHPtourhmbSeE5m0nhM\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378937117216768013746.jpeg/ycrKGRm-9zHDSEmJeCF2uLMXasV4FS9dL2OCoS9jgqE\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378927524319232875062.jpeg/int2eWWSDYpRcmJr1BuepLTB5pJIXPvpVb1WrlW9Vq4\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378930007478272293180.jpeg/M2RIoVsV4OZm6qhfqNQ7Oyhz97GcF7csQhE21UIRNtU\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378932608077824637429.jpeg/AwKSRG9hJEq36xaw6DT5tsijgjOwvTFNKRNHrCkTR6w\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378935099625472536701.jpeg/jhPDRUPlYsYSvTICkU6OfqwGKFsxVGesRiHBikYhwYo\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378937184325632378146.jpeg/u61TEf64meCYORLrd6qnGJk3p5U4n_UeJElLUCRJS1A\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378926312165376483692.jpeg/Cm_0u3HNHpBgTZ-11L-s5bkKm9dxJXhWVd5DuVXeQ7k\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378929361555456681539.jpeg/hTSt4QHG6GcauI5Xc9GKtJ-R1jzZ7Si-C5ZiOAuWYjg\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378931945377792813902.jpeg/Oy059aCNVDzi9LDzDa9Sw4vnZkbvEpu_K_usoCv7rKA\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378934122352640051239.jpeg/TOBX0oZ38Gggc0wfOE4JR3B9-s9T7j1zzG6z8cxus_E\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378936248995840861359.jpeg/_gDDv5cArFlgKWA_ya3eakfkKSN5NJ3SQYO370GDt-8\" alt=\"孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸（Instagram@aimeeyunyunsun）</figcaption></figure><p>母女倆站在滿滿白色花朵與笑臉氣球布景前開心合影。孫芸芸身穿簡約白色T恤，對著鏡頭嘟嘴賣萌，狀態凍齡；廖思惟則以黑色上衣搭配一頭長髮入鏡，氣質相當優雅。兩人不僅五官神似，互動也自然親密，宛如姊妹淘一般。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378170465030144135704.jpeg/kJmGvDgK9Ztqo5HMNRjCtwBYdrs7ZKBMLEPXBixD1wY\" alt=\"孫芸芸(右)歡度48歲生日，女兒廖思惟一起慶生。（小紅書@Trinity 廖思惟）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸(右)歡度48歲生日，女兒廖思惟一起慶生。（小紅書@Trinity 廖思惟）</figcaption></figure><p>照片曝光後，網友紛紛留言狂讚：</p><p>「完全分不出誰是媽媽、誰是女兒」</p><p>「根本兩姊妹」</p><p>「媽媽太年輕了吧」</p><p>「還以為是閨密」</p><p>「迷人的姊妹花」</p><p>「大姊姊跟小妹妹的感覺」</p><p>還有人驚呼：「孫芸芸狀態真的太好了！」不少粉絲也湧入留言區獻上生日祝福，再度掀起一波凍齡話題。</p><p>延伸閱讀：孫芸芸千金廖思惟未婚產女　男方曬相竟遮自己樣　遭網民起底狂轟</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260324/1113142351611957248578241.jpeg/1DNR3DnYn7WUPwjAbu0i7YoVpH7oX8KI9Wyz3vVss94\" alt=\"【延伸閱讀：孫芸芸千金廖思惟未婚產女　男方曬相竟遮自己樣　遭網民起底狂轟】孫芸芸女兒廖思惟秘密赴澳生b，從她之前社媒發佈的相片看，絲毫看不出懷孕的痕跡。（Instagram@trinityliao）\"><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：孫芸芸千金廖思惟未婚產女　男方曬相竟遮自己樣　遭網民起底狂轟】孫芸芸女兒廖思惟秘密赴澳生b，從她之前社媒發佈的相片看，絲毫看不出懷孕的痕跡。（Instagram@trinityliao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260324/1113142351876198400769021.jpeg/Y6LNhqoKi32MIHNrjiRfXz77jDPB3u139gjyLPYI8iw\" alt=\"孫芸芸女兒廖思惟秘密赴澳生b，從她之前社媒發佈的相片看，絲毫看不出懷孕的痕跡。（Instagram@trinityliao）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸女兒廖思惟秘密赴澳生b，從她之前社媒發佈的相片看，絲毫看不出懷孕的痕跡。（Instagram@trinityliao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260324/1113142353923149824183906.jpeg/Qe9-C3a7tfSIIZgJW3zH8Zwiws0JOX4oaHHxz2hx8c8\" alt=\"孫芸芸女兒廖思惟秘密赴澳生b，從她之前社媒發佈的相片看，絲毫看不出懷孕的痕跡。（Instagram@trinityliao）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸女兒廖思惟秘密赴澳生b，從她之前社媒發佈的相片看，絲毫看不出懷孕的痕跡。（Instagram@trinityliao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260324/1113142353998647296504638.jpeg/2-oKUR8CDDxSl4EwH6ubcPXkKjFbG9ELJSf4lSUn-JU\" alt=\"孫芸芸女兒廖思惟秘密赴澳生b，從她之前社媒發佈的相片看，絲毫看不出懷孕的痕跡。（Instagram@trinityliao）\"><figcaption>孫芸芸女兒廖思惟秘密赴澳生b，從她之前